title: "Open Data Governance Standard (ODGS)"
abstract: "The Open Data Governance Standard (ODGS) is a vendor-neutral protocol that resolves the Definition-Execution Gap in High-Risk AI systems through Semantic Binding, Tri-Partite Audit, and the Sovereign Handshake. v6.0.0 introduces SOFT_STOP severity, batch evaluation, rule dependency chains, webhook emission, conformance self-checks, and rule versioning for EU AI Act compliance via Metric Provenance."
